            <title>1.1.5</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 08:40:25 +0530</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Fixes clicking on clips, which stopped working in 1.1.4. Adds a Settings button at the top of the sidebar, and Clippy now shows in the window and the menu bar when a new version is available.</p>
]]></description>
